Unless I'm mistaken, he actually tells you that it would be better
protected if you had it or something like that...

The Tsurugi of Muramasa is one of the best weapons in the games, but
it's a two-handed sword, so you can't use a shield while wielding it.
Also, it is rustproof (try reading about it with '/' sometime...)
One minor spoiler:

Similar to the vorpal blade, the Tsurugi has a chance to bisect your
opponent, if man size or smaller, for an instant kill. If the are
larger than man-size, it still 'cuts deeply', for extra damage. Maybe
someone with the source code handy could give us a 'cut deeply'
add-on/multiplier? ;^)

